{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-03_beg",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-03",
  "title": "同時走失",
  "storyCode": "6-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fdfd7d4d7a44533e3c5138860a0deaff99e291a84ef7ca0585bb81e5e5f1d066",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "梅菲斯特？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "你剛才釋放了什麼法術？你的......隊伍，比之前更狂躁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "他們......他們很痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "啊，你看到了啊？我種下去的種子開花了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "沒事的，浮士德，他們不會攻擊我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "你還在催化他們的感染？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "梅菲斯特......停手吧。我們能活下去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "只有我的法術能做到這種事情，也只有這樣，我們才有可能逃出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "你在偵察的時候也看得很清楚了吧，如果我們以現在的狀態強行突破，近衛局在我們抵達貧民區的秘密通道之前，就能把我們全殺掉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "你以前見過那些武器嗎？那些連切爾諾伯格的守衛都沒用過的武器！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "他們太熟悉這座城市了，而我們只是些外來人！他們從哪裡出現？又會在哪裡消失？！僅憑現在這點人，我們沒法與他們正面對抗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "切爾諾伯格的烏薩斯人太弱了......龍門把我們當軍隊看待，可我們不是軍隊，我們帶領著的，只是些想活下去的同胞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "聲音輕些。我們的士氣相當低落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "但我的牧群根本不會因為這種事情動搖！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "......還有剛剛和我們會合的很多整合運動成員在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "霜星一定會來支援我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "霜星？那個霜星？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "呵，呵呵，她和她的雪怪，難道不是也背叛了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "梅菲斯特！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "否則憑他們的實力，有什麼能攔得住他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "我不怪他們。哪怕是背叛，他們也只是為了生存。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "霜星不會背叛。我們不是說好了，要自己去看到真相？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "是啊......大家都在為了生存而努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "別衝動，別被近衛局的計策衝昏頭腦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "我有辦法，浮士德。我可以讓我的同胞們更好地活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "......？你要做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "我要讓近衛局看看比軍隊更可怕的東西。他們絕對無法想像我同胞們綻放出的花朵是什麼樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "梅菲斯特？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "近衛局一定要為他們的所作所為付出代價......那個陳，一定要為傷害你付出代價！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "我的同胞們，我的族裔們，回應我吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的牧群",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_015",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "你們的體內有著遠比現在更旺盛的生命......去追索那種衝動，去散播你們的種子、你們的未來吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "不，梅菲斯特！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "他們是活的人啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的牧群",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（混亂的尖叫聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "整個龍門都是你們的土壤！去啊，去把你們的生命傳遞給其他人！快去，快去，快去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？啊？！怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你，你要幹嘛？我們和你不是一個小隊的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我沒在背後說過你們什麼！也沒說梅菲斯特......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隊長？隊長呢？！隊長！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊！！怎，怎麼，你怎麼咬我！！為什麼......呃呃呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "救命！！救命！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊啊啊啊，啊！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "哼哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "他們比以前更強了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "雖然他們已經聽不見我的聲音了，但他們不會再攻擊我們......他們會越來越壯、越來越強、越來越多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "龍門會被它們徹底毀滅。哼，我的同胞們得不到龍門，龍門人也別想繼續保留這座城市！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "浮士德，走吧，我們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "浮士德？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "你做了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（痛苦的嘶嚎）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "浮士德？你去哪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "浮士德！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "為什麼梅菲斯特的手下在攻擊我們？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "我好像看到......糟糕，糟糕，剛才被他們拖走的伊萬......我看到了！伊萬好像也變成那種樣子了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "蘇卡，什麼怪物......這是什麼怪物！！打了他們也不會痛，刺了也不會死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "他們比剛才狂躁了好幾倍！我們已經有點打不過了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "你們，跟我來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "浮士德？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "別去，可能是梅菲斯特的陷阱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "......這小子救過我的命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "梅菲斯特是個混蛋，他不一定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "從這裡走，快。幻影弩手會保護你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "謝謝......等，等下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "當心！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "——源石投擲物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerToken": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "portraitKey": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "快走！牧群的目標是你們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "灰喉，敵人的動向很奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "重裝幹員會盡力維持陣線，我們術師著重削減敵人的數量，有法術能力的感染者，就交給你和其他狙擊幹員處理了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1",
      "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
      "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
      "text": "我射殺感染者，也是可以容許的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "灰喉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "有可能的話，我不容許任何人傷害感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "只是，我是不是允許別人這麼做，別人是不是允許感染者傷害其他人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "沒有任何意義。這些學說在戰場上沒有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "如果真的有可能，沒人應該傷害他人。無論是感染者還是普通人，都一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
      "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
      "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
      "text": "我會照做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "嘉維爾會為我們提供醫療支援，所以......注意自己的狀況，別受傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......奇怪？那些是......梅菲斯特的牧群......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "但我......我怎麼一點情感都感受不到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不對。不對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "灰喉，快下來！事情不對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
      "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
      "text": "它們......竟然在拔出身上的源石？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "灰喉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#6",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "博士！你沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我沒事！你小心！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "哪冒出來這麼多牧群？動作都完全變了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "算了，你那位置還算比較安全！待在那別動！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "我先把這些東西都解決了再說！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
